WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.338
A table links input and output. Describe the pattern as an algebraic rule and test it

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.301
with two rows.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:14.915
A table follows y equals 6n plus 4. Calculate y for n equals 5. The answer is 34. 6

00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:17.378
times 5 plus 4 equals 34.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.031
A fare chart at a farm follows output equals 8 times input plus 0. What output

00:00:24.031 --> 00:00:26.947
matches input 5? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:33.711
A fare chart at a farm follows output equals 8 times input plus 0. What output

00:00:33.711 --> 00:00:38.898
matches input 5? The answer is 40. 8 times 5 plus 0 equals 40.
